# src2 Platform Capabilities Components Audit

## Overview
This document identifies the best components from `src2` for showcasing **full platform capabilities** (what the platform can DO) rather than just listing features.

## 📊 EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

**Total Components Found**: 10 capability-showcase components  
**Already Extracted**: 5 core components + 3 data files ✅  
**Available for Extraction**: 5 additional components + 2 data files ⚠️  
**Complete Product Pages**: 5 reference pages showing component composition

**Key Finding**: `src2` contains a comprehensive library of platform capability components, with multiple variations for different use cases (compact, detailed, developer-focused, product-specific).

---

## 🎯 KEY COMPONENTS FOR PLATFORM CAPABILITIES

### 1. **VisualCapabilityGrid** ⭐ RECOMMENDED
**Location**: `src/src2/components/site/blocks/VisualCapabilityGrid.tsx`

**What It Does**:
- Shows capabilities with **interactive expandable cards**
- Displays **metrics** (AUROC, accuracy, etc.)
- Includes **live demo components** embedded in cards
- Shows **key features** for each capability
- Click-to-expand for more details

**Perfect For**: 
- Multi-modal predictions showcase
- Oracle capabilities with live demos
- Interactive capability exploration

**Data Structure**:
```typescript
interface Capability {
  id: string;
  icon: string;
  title: string;
  description: string;
  metrics: Array<{
    value: string;
    label: string;
    color: string;
  }>;
  keyFeatures: string[];
  demoComponent?: React.ReactNode; // LIVE DEMO EMBEDDED
}
```

**Example Usage** (from OracleProduct.tsx):
```typescript
<VisualCapabilityGrid
  capabilities={oracleCapabilities.multiModalPredictions}
  title="Multi-Modal Biological Predictions"
  subtitle="Oracle's comprehensive biological insights across multiple modalities."
/>
```

**Key Advantages**:
- ✅ Shows WHAT the platform can DO (not just features)
- ✅ Interactive with embedded demos
- ✅ Metrics-driven (real performance data)
- ✅ Expandable for details

---

