## 💡 KEY INSIGHT

**The difference**:
- **Features** = "We have variant prediction" (WHAT we have)
- **Capabilities** = "Predict variant impact with 95.7% AUROC across all variant types" (WHAT we can DO)

**VisualCapabilityGrid** shows CAPABILITIES with:
- Real metrics
- Live demonstrations
- Use case examples
- Interactive exploration

This aligns perfectly with showing "full platform capabilities - not based on features."

